<title>UK: Granada sells Westbury to Chelsfield.</title>
<headline>Granada sells Westbury to Chelsfield.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British media and leisure group Granada Group Plc said on Tuesday it sold its Westbury hotels in London and New York to Chelsfield Plc for 90 million stg.</p>
</text>
